#: index.php:312
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Mae Rufus yn declyn sy'n helpu i fformatio a chreu gyriannau fflach USB "
"cychwynadwy fel allweddi USB/gyriannau cof, coeon bach, ac ati."

#: index.php:313
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Gall fod yn arbennig o ddefnyddiol ar gyfer achosion lle:"

#: index.php:315
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"mae angen i chi greu cyfryngau gosod USB o ISOau cychwynadwy (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, ac ati)"

#: index.php:316
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr ""
"mae angen i chi weithio ar system sydd heb system weithredu wedi'i gosod"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "mae angen i chi fflachio BIOS neu galedwar arall o DOS"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "rydych chi eisiau rhedeg teclyn lefel isel"

#: index.php:320
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Er ei fod yn fychan, mae Rufus yn darparu popeth sydd ei angen arnoch chi!"

#: index.php:321
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom "
"of this page."
msgstr ""
"Mae rhestr anghyflawn o ISOau sy'n cael ei cefnogi gan Rufus ar waelod y "
"dudalen hon hefyd."

