msgstr "Gofynion System:"

#: index.php:378
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 neu'n hwyrach."

#: index.php:378
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Ar ôl ei lwytho i lawr, mae'r rhaglen yn barod i'w defnyddio."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Ieithoedd sy'n cael eu Cefnogi:"

#: index.php:425
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Hoffwn fanteisio ar y cyfle hwn i fynegi fy niolchgarwch i'r cyfieithwyr "
"wnaeth hi'n bosibl i Rufus, yn ogystal â'r dudalen we hon, gael eu cyfieithu "
"i wahanol ieithoedd. Os byddwch chi'n profi eich bod chi'n gallu defnyddio "
"Rufus yn eich iaith eich hun, dylech chi ddiolch yn fawr iddyn nhw!"

#: index.php:429
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Llwythwch y ffeil weithredadwy i lawr a'i rhedeg &ndash; does dim angen ei "
"gosod."

#: index.php:430
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr ""
"Mae'r ffeil weithredadwy wedi'i llofnodi'n ddigidol a dylai'r llofnod "
"ddatgan:"

#: index.php:432
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 neu'n ddiweddarach)"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 neu'n gynharach)"

#: index.php:435
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Nodiadau ar gefnogaeth DOS:"

#: index.php:436
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Os ydych chi'n creu gyriant cychwynadwy DOS ac yn defnyddio bysellfwrdd nad "
"yw'n un o'r Unol Daleithiau, bydd Rufus yn ceisio dewis cynllun bysellfwrdd "
"yn ôl lleoliad eich system."

#: index.php:437
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Nodiadau ar Gymorth ISO:"

#: index.php:438
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from "
"an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Mae pob fersiwn o Rufus ers v1.1.0 yn caniatáu creu USB cychwynadwy o <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ddelwedd ISO</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the "
"freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mae creu delwedd ISO o ddisg gorfforol neu o set o ffeiliau yn hawdd iawn "
"i'w wneud fodd bynnag, trwy ddefnyddio rhaglen llosgi CD, fel <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> neu <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>CDBurnerXP</a> sydd ar gael am ddim."

#: index.php:442
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Cwestiynau Cyffredin"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:443
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Mae Cwestiynau Cyffredin Rufus ar gael <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>YMA</a></"
"b>."

#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"I roi adborth, rhoi gwybod am wall neu ofyn am welliant, defnyddiwch <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>traciwr materion</a> GitHub. Neu gallwch <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>anfon e-bost</a> ."

#: index.php:447
msgid "License"
msgstr "Trwydded"

#: index.php:448
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>Trwydded Gyhoeddus Gyffredinol GNU (GPL) fersiwn 3</"
"a> neu'n ddiweddarach."

#: index.php:448
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you "
"respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Rydych chi'n rhydd i ddosbarthu, addasu neu hyd yn oed werthu'r feddalwedd, "
"cyn belled â'ch bod chi'n parchu'r drwydded GPLv3."

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"Mae Rufus yn cael ei gynhyrchu mewn modd 100%% tryloyw, o'i <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ffynhonnell gyhoeddus</a>, gan ddefnyddio amgylchedd <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> ."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:452
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Cofnod Newid"

#: index.php:488
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Fel arall, gallwch glonio'r storfa <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> gan "
"ddefnyddio:"

#: index.php:490
#, php-format
msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr ""
"Am ragor o wybodaeth, ewch i'r <a target=\"_blank\" %s>project GitHub</a> ."

#: index.php:491
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Os ydych chi'n ddatblygwr, rydym yn eich annog i chwarae gyda Rufus a "
"chyflwyno gwelliannau."

#: index.php:494
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Rhoddion"

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Gan fy mod yn cael fy holi am hyn yn rheolaidd, does <b>dim</b> botwm rhoi "
"ar y dudalen hon."

#: index.php:496
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Y prif reswm yw fy mod i'n teimlo nad yw'r system rhoi mewn gwirionedd yn "
"helpu datblygu meddalwedd ac yn waeth byth, gall achosi i ddefnyddwyr sy'n "
"dewis peidio â rhoi deimlo'n euog."

#: index.php:499
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Os ydych chi wir yn mynnu, gallwch chi bob amser wneud cyfraniad i'r <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a> , gan mai nhw yw'r prif "
"reswm pam mae meddalwedd fel Rufus yn bosibl."

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much "
"appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Beth bynnag, byddaf yn manteisio ar y cyfle hwn i <i><u>ddiolch i chi</u></"
"i> am eich cefnogaeth a'ch brwdfrydedd parhaus am y rhaglen fach hon: mae'n "
"cael ei werthfawrogi'n fawr!"

#: index.php:501
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Ond cofiwch i barhau i ddefnyddio Rufus heb unrhyw euogrwydd am beidio â "
"chyfrannu ato'n ariannol - dylech chi byth orfod gwneud hynny!"

#: index.php:504
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr ""
"Rhestr anghyflawn o ISOau rydym yn gwybod bod Rufus yn gweithio gyda nhw"

